Package: calibcheck
Type: Package
Title: Audit Normalized Calibration Weights
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Hurcheson Asante", "Ofori", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "oforihurcheson@gmail.com")
Author: Hurcheson Asante Ofori [aut, cre, cph]
Maintainer: Hurcheson Asante Ofori <oforihurcheson@gmail.com>
Description: Independent diagnostics for whether binary target
    margins can be attained using nonnegative normalized weights. Reports
    numerical primal and dual residual bounds, checks rational certificates,
    and separates achieved balance from numerical convergence.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: lpSolve
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
URL: https://github.com/hurcheson/calibcheck,
    https://hurcheson.github.io/calibcheck/
BugReports: https://github.com/hurcheson/calibcheck/issues
